@flexiarg operator/ask-what-is-still-needed-on-a-named-item
@title ask what is still needed on a named item
@status accepted 2026-11-11: proposed by 象 for 2 turns (Joe 2026-11-11: recurrence suffices); attested once used in a mission or a War Machine cascade
@provenance 象 proposals, ~/.emacs-graph/session-turn-analysis/<record>[.json].candidates.json; records: turn-02LxGw turn-UGIA3X; first proposed for: An item is close to closure and a plan is wanted.
@why [system-coherence/bind-open-questions-to-closure-mechanisms]

! conclusion: Answer with what remains on the item, what each piece depends on, and whether any is done.

  + IF:
    The operator asks for a detailed roundup of what would be needed to close it.

  + HOWEVER:
    Detailed asks for more than a short answer.

  + THEN:
    Answer with what remains on the item, what each piece depends on, and whether any is done.

  + BECAUSE:
    The plan needs the full list.
